{"title":"Cardio Electrocardiograma -","guid":"","filepath":"/Users/criaah/Vault/📚 Resources/Mapas-Mentales/Apuntes-de-Clases/Cardiogeriatria-Curso-2025/09 - Plenaria Modulo 2 (preguntas) (Barrenechea-Jadue-Nauhm).smmx","root":{"id":"0","parent":"-1","text":"## Plenaria Módulo 2","guid":"YYgsI70CQfiSjBwAiQ2waA","children":[{"id":"1","parent":"0","text":"Temas debatidos","guid":"YihxGQ7wTvO5ssFywWTgew","children":[{"id":"2","parent":"1","text":"Ejercicio CV en sistema público (Jadue)","guid":"fKKO39XjQs6zt48gWhugxQ","children":[{"id":"3","parent":"2","text":"P: ¿Qué hacer si no hay acceso a rehab CV?","guid":"vZeoYg54Rr2VX0FgjZ47-w","children":[{"id":"4","parent":"3","text":"R consenso: reactivar AVD + caminata + escaleras","guid":"Xf4rRiozS2KvMCSXCvF3Kw","children":[]},{"id":"5","parent":"3","text":"Reposo prescrito = iatrogenia","guid":"YsBZe3w1SQGXJv9zDv2psw","children":[]},{"id":"6","parent":"3","text":"Meta funcional: \"subir 2 pisos\"","guid":"y_tpLZfKQpegZJV4NoDY_g","children":[]},{"id":"7","parent":"3","text":"Kinesiología domiciliaria si es costeable","guid":"Rde7BEzzSLS9A_CZdIilRg","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"8","parent":"1","text":"FA en persona mayor (Nauhm)","guid":"fAIcPJcdRO-VB4NDPSTn2w","children":[{"id":"9","parent":"8","text":"P: ¿Ritmo vs. frecuencia? ¿Qué fármaco?","guid":"K7NtFjYzSEeTdSiF_CRhHA","children":[{"id":"10","parent":"9","text":"R consenso fármaco","guid":"7qFvFxNRRci8VVJJrGbPmg","children":[{"id":"11","parent":"10","text":"Disfunción VI → amiodarona (vigilar tiroides)","guid":"HOfVRhSFQnSh-6haM37Msg","children":[]},{"id":"12","parent":"10","text":"VI conservado → flecainida (c/12 h) > propafenona (c/8 h)","guid":"vAhbE6xuTXCJsb_EsF6xcg","children":[]},{"id":"13","parent":"10","text":"IC siempre con β-bloqueador en dosis baja (25-50 mg c/12 h)","guid":"UWFacSwlS0Gb49fo576_0g","children":[]}]},{"id":"14","parent":"9","text":"R consenso estrategia","guid":"zMpxv51FSFmcrdJfSshstA","children":[{"id":"15","parent":"14","text":"AI severamente dilatada + FA larga data → frecuencia","guid":"m3_8xGiCTbSFoaWql7E3Yg","children":[]},{"id":"16","parent":"14","text":"AI levemente dilatada + VI ok → cardioversión razonable","guid":"uHcQGttqRz-1yKWdAHuwOg","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"17","parent":"8","text":"P: ¿Riesgo de cardioversión eléctrica en AM?","guid":"OETNkcoqRxu6Q-jr038GvA","children":[{"id":"18","parent":"17","text":"R consenso: bajo riesgo si hospitalizado + monitorizado","guid":"ICf2oYQiT7eQ20g3cTmMxA","children":[]},{"id":"19","parent":"17","text":"FEVI <30% → pensar 2 veces (aturdimiento)","guid":"w3JdmpB9TT6O3f74sD284Q","children":[]},{"id":"20","parent":"17","text":"Riesgo trombótico ×7 primer mes → anticoagulación estricta","guid":"y4OREjwXQ4iAzFCGOZU0MQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"21","parent":"1","text":"Prehabilitación (Barrenechea)","guid":"wzVXTgYUThaiUHX-g8L4rw","children":[{"id":"22","parent":"21","text":"P: ¿Dónde se hace? ¿Cualquier kinesiólogo?","guid":"o1hY9QaxSgy_UrF5HM5k_A","children":[{"id":"23","parent":"22","text":"R consenso centros: cualquier programa formal de rehab CV","guid":"GMxGtLygRlyHql3DQdYqFA","children":[{"id":"24","parent":"23","text":"Clínica Alemana como referencia","guid":"zBESoheERU-0knPjLHSFFQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"25","parent":"22","text":"R consenso profesional","guid":"a3_JsTXOSCOGHXcbFlfTPQ","children":[{"id":"26","parent":"25","text":"Población sana → kinesiólogo o EF","guid":"Emd8eSiHRdCe8JlYwCa87A","children":[]},{"id":"27","parent":"25","text":"Paciente con comorbilidades → kinesiólogo especialista (rehab cardíaca + geriátrico)","guid":"3CWmKPzlR4ehgMhtaSKBWw","children":[]}]},{"id":"28","parent":"22","text":"Acotación: sin evaluación (fragilidad, cap. funcional) no hay norte","guid":"wW2tMGb7TmCbA2QNti74pQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"29","parent":"1","text":"Anticoagulación en paliativo (puente final)","guid":"KUYdxuyxTKW58xwYZboNcw","children":[{"id":"30","parent":"29","text":"P: ¿Cuándo retirar anticoagulante en paciente paliativo?","guid":"nD7yzsDxRmyWUyuXzd67rA","children":[{"id":"31","parent":"30","text":"R consenso: distinguir paliativo vs. terminal","guid":"B3_AyR3LSI-XSlQ9D-JPgw","children":[{"id":"32","parent":"31","text":"Paliativo CV (manejo integral precoz) → NO retirar","guid":"5JOSHCUGRRmV7Wvxy_l6fQ","children":[]},{"id":"33","parent":"31","text":"Terminal (sobrevida <3-4 meses, postración) → razonable suspender","guid":"PJPRc72ETnWRcXmK_n8N3Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"34","parent":"30","text":"No extrapolar conducta oncológica al cardiovascular","guid":"Qe9ZL3GhSDurVDYqnblurA","children":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"35","parent":"0","text":"Perlas únicas","guid":"CmX8QRkQTHGBc5clj3-BxQ","children":[{"id":"36","parent":"35","text":"\"Algo siempre es mejor que nada\" — Jadue","guid":"q1UMWOuwSOKrabV7AePyLA","children":[]},{"id":"37","parent":"35","text":"Flecainida > propafenona en geriatría por posología","guid":"IYzzZm99QSax0qbMe3pxdA","children":[]},{"id":"38","parent":"35","text":"AI dilatada + FA larga = predictor de fracaso de control de ritmo","guid":"8CmEdg7pRBWC-PFRBN5B_w","children":[]},{"id":"39","parent":"35","text":"Cardioversión: trombosis ×7 el primer mes","guid":"kqeqM9RtRryIpgeiBhI3Eg","children":[]},{"id":"40","parent":"35","text":"Paliativo CV ≠ paliativo oncológico","guid":"EsY0Fq65TCWtyOXcctsJhw","children":[]},{"id":"41","parent":"35","text":"Sin evaluación funcional inicial, no hay prescripción válida","guid":"G17qPHTKT-qsg4Bv9bOiXA","children":[]}]},{"id":"42","parent":"0","text":"Cross-refs","guid":"WYg1TbE9RB6NA0kc9iVGYA","children":[{"id":"43","parent":"42","text":"09-jadue-ejercicio-cv","guid":"e2dt6qa0Q4WJ3wlhoq8mSQ","children":[]},{"id":"44","parent":"42","text":"09-nauhm-fa-am","guid":"ZUqGwMc4SRyr0pI1bZmj4A","children":[]},{"id":"45","parent":"42","text":"09-barrenechea-prehabilitacion","guid":"6L8Nxq7ATQGw8OJCydBfWg","children":[]}]},{"id":"46","parent":"0","text":"Referencias","guid":"c0tgWiSOQVaNQkjcMNTIgQ","children":[{"id":"47","parent":"46","text":"Curso Cardiogeriatría 2025 SGGCh — Plenaria Módulo 2","guid":"t1c4HvSsRWCm83gfnqQxvA","children":[]},{"id":"48","parent":"46","text":"Transcripción: 09-plenaria-modulo2.txt (578 líneas)","guid":"qtVCj3zFQqumFfVTKunuTQ","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":48,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Cardiología","folder":"Entidades clínicas/Cardiología","filename":"Cardio Electrocardiograma -","id":"map_45","resolved_references":[]}